window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I've been burned.</p> <p>One of my secrets is out in the open, and it couldn't have happened at a worse time. The people of the city need a hero right now, and it can't be me. It's too risky. I could lose everything.</p> <p>While everything falls to chaos, I've got some hard decisions to make.</p> <p>There's a fine line between hero and tyrant. I need to figure out how to dance down that line so I can be the leader they need, without turning into the monster they fear.</p>"; 
